BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventaarchwaystothepast3aafricanamericanhistorybustour24104-20260523@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20260926T141911Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260523
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261025
SUMMARY:AARCHways to the Past: African American History Bus Tour
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a powerful and enlightening one hour journey aboard our vintage 1966 double-decker bus\, exploring the rich and often untold stories of Frederick’s African American community. In partnership with the African American Resources Cultural and Heritage Society (AARCH)\, this professionally guided tour will take you through historic neighborhoods\, landmarks\, and sites of significance\, highlighting the resilience\, culture\, and contributions of African Americans in Frederick from the 1800’s to today. Led by knowledgeable local guides\, you’ll hear firsthand accounts\, compelling narratives\, and inspiring histories that shaped the city’s identity and continue to resonate in the present. Discover Frederick’s past through voices that still echo today. TOUR HIGHLIGHTS: • Ride aboard a beautifully restored 1966 double-decker bus • Learn about Frederick’s African American history from AARCH docents • Visit important cultural landmarks and heritage sites • Engage with stories of strength\, resistance\, and community • A moving educational experience for all ages
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/aarchways-to-the-past%3a-african-american-history-bus-tour/24104/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventafricanamericanhistorywalkingtour15513-20260523@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20260926T141911Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260523
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261025
SUMMARY:African American History Walking Tour
DESCRIPTION:Step into history with the AARCH Society Walking Tour! Led by tour guides from Frederick's Black Community who share first hand experiences and stories. Join us as we uncover the rich African American history\, stories\, landmarks\, and legacies that helped shape our community. Bring your walking shoes and experience Frederick through a powerful new authentic lens.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/african-american-history-walking-tour/15513/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventreptileadventuresonthedouble23231-20260523@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20260926T141911Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260523
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260927
SUMMARY:Reptile Adventures on the Double
DESCRIPTION:Frederick’s Wildest Family Tour on a Vintage Double-Decker Bus (with Actual Reptiles and Mild Panic) Looking for family activities in Frederick\, Maryland that don’t involve folding laundry or bribing your children with snacks? Then climb aboard Reptile Adventures on the Double\, a truly spectacular vintage London double-decker bus tour that mixes city sightseeing\, laughter\, and live lizards into one gloriously chaotic day out! Your adventure begins in Downtown Frederick\, where our enormous yellow double-decker awaits\, gleaming like a misplaced banana among the cobblestones. Once aboard\, you’ll be greeted by our Clippie (that’s British for “guide with excellent posture and an unpredictable sense of humour”)\, who will lead you on a scenic and slightly unhinged tour through Frederick’s historic streets. Expect fascinating local stories\, spontaneous singalongs\, and the occasional warning about what not to feed an iguana. The second half of this grand voyage\, the bus makes a dramatic stop for a live reptile show with Wolfe’s Exotic Encounter in Frederick! You and your brave offspring will come face-to-face with snakes\, turtles\, lizards\, and other scaly ambassadors of chaos\, each guaranteed to produce shrieks\, laughter\, and at least one “Mum\, can we keep it?” moment. Educational? Absolutely. Sensible? Debatable. Unforgettable? Completely. So if you’re searching for things to do with kids in Frederick\, fun Maryland family tours\, or a Frederick double-decker bus ride that includes actual reptiles\, history\, and humour\, this is your golden ticket. * To ensure a smooth experience for everyone\, all guests sitting in a seat must purchase a ticket. Children under 3 can sit on a parent or guardian's lap without a ticket. Thank you for your understanding!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/reptile-adventures-on-the-double/23231/
END:VEVENT
