UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventautumnliqueurrelease11437-20260926@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20260926T141911Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260926
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260927
SUMMARY:Autumn Liqueur Release
DESCRIPTION:Feel the crispness in the air? Craving somethin' a little hot and spicy? Just in time for our favorite fall release: Autumn Liqueur. And joining the party this year is the Pomegranate Apple Crush. Get ready\, Saturday\, September 26 from noon to 10 p.m. we'll be offering tastings\, full pours\, spirit tasting flights and cocktails made from your favorite fall elixir. We'll have an entirely new seasonal menu for you to try. Mark your calendars\, because this one won't last. Autumn Liqueur Description: Tenth Ward’s original apple brandy made from McCutcheon's apple cider\, melded with ginger\, plum\, black tea\, turmeric\, allspice\, cinchona bark\, sage\, fennel\, saffron\, and slightly sweetened with local honey. Tasting Notes: A smack of dry champagne\, bourbon-like innuendos and whispers of tart apple.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/autumn-liqueur-release/11437/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventbilateralartwithjessiebunk25934-20260926@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20260926T141911Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260926
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260927
SUMMARY:Bilateral Art with Jessie Bunk
DESCRIPTION:Explore the creative possibilities of working with both hands at once in this playful\, beginner-friendly art workshop. Bilateral art uses repetitive movements on both sides of the body to encourage focus\, relaxation\, and imagination while creating. Students will experiment with a variety of bilateral art techniques\, including continuous-line drawing\, mark-making\, and pattern. Working with both hands encourages you to focus on the process rather than the finished product\, making this a relaxed and accessible way to explore creativity and stay present in the moment.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/bilateral-art-with-jessie-bunk/25934/
END:VEVENT
