UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventliveinfinitytribe26nester26035-20260926@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20260926T141911Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260926
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260927
SUMMARY:LIVE! Infinity Tribe & Nester
DESCRIPTION:Three nationally touring jam powerhouses take over Frederick for a night of blissful debauchery! Frederick-rooted and nationally rising\, Natalie Brooke brings The Infinity Tribe home for a rare Frederick appearance. It's time to turn this town upside down! Frederick is about to be graced with a night of blissful funk fusion by three of Maryland's finest. Infinity Tribe & Nester at Carroll Creek Amphitheater - 5pm-10pm $15 tickets Join us for a night of amazing jams! Rain or shine.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/live!-infinity-tribe-%26-nester/26035/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventmakingpizzafromscratch26029-20260926@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20260926T141911Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260926
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261012
SUMMARY:Making Pizza from Scratch
DESCRIPTION:In this 2.5-hour hands-on class\, you will learn how to make pizza from scratch\, pull some fresh mozzarella\, and select from many ingredients to top your pizza including fresh veg and herbs growing seasonally at Chocolates and Tomatoes Farm. We use propane-powered portable outdoor pizza ovens. NOTE: OUTDOORS CLASS Chef Mark will do the following and then participants will practice on their own and go home with their own personal-sized pizza. Demonstrate how to make the pizza dough Show how to shape the dough for your pizza Demonstrate how to make fresh mozzarella cheese Provide tips on selecting the fresh veggie and herb options for your pizza (and talk about how we grow them on the farm) Show how to cook the pizza in the oven Operate the oven when you are cooking your pizza No cooking experience necessary. We will have hot coffee and tea\, and cold water available\, Feel free to bring nonalcoholic beverages with you. Classes are designed for adults. Teens and tweens may attend with a supportive\, registered adult. S ign up for future classes and see what else is going on at the farm here: https://www.chocolatesandtomatoes.com/ Chef Mark enjoys sharing what he has learned in his 35+ year cooking career and through his pastry arts training at La'Academie de Cuisine. Although we just launched The Learning Kitchen at Chocolates and Tomatoes Farm in 2023\, Chef Mark has been mentoring others throughout his career and teaching culinary arts at Frederick Community College since 2019.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/making-pizza-from-scratch/26029/
END:VEVENT
