BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventonevasthospital3adowntownfrederickwalkingtour14482-20260926@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20260926T141911Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260926
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260927
SUMMARY:One Vast Hospital: Downtown Frederick Walking Tour
DESCRIPTION:Explore the incredible Civil War history in Downtown Frederick with expert guides from the National Museum of Civil War Medicine. Every Saturday at 10:30 a.m. and Sunday at 12:00 p.m. from April until September\, docents from the National Museum of Civil War Medicine will explain how Frederick became “One Vast Hospital.” Arguably the most trying moment in city’s history came after the Battle of Antietam in the fall of 1862. The town’s population doubled when 8\,000 wounded soldiers were delivered by ambulance to make-shift hospitals throughout Frederick. Walking tours last for an hour to an hour and a half. Tickets are $15 and include admission to the National Museum of Civil War Medicine in addition to the walking tour. Tickets are free for Museum members\, but you must still reserve your spot. Reservations will be accepted on a first come first served basis. Contact Chris Reed at chris.reed@civilwarmed.org for more information.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/one-vast-hospital%3a-downtown-frederick-walking-tour/14482/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventsalsanightdancepartyw2livebands26081-20260926@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20260926T141911Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260926
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260927
SUMMARY:SALSA NIGHT Dance Party w/ 2 Live Bands
DESCRIPTION:Frederick Salsa New Season invites you to an unforgettable night of music\, dancing\, and great vibes! Please dress to impress * semi-formal attire. Get ready for an incredible evening featuring two amazing live salsa bands battling for the best sound and the best energy on the dance floor! Add in great music\, delicious drinks\, friendly people\, and an atmosphere full of passion for salsa\, and you have the perfect Saturday night. 🎧 Music by DJ Elijah between sets to keep the dance floor moving all night long. Whether you’re an experienced dancer or just love great Latin music\, everyone is welcome. Bring your friends\, invite your family\, and come make memories with the Frederick salsa community. Mark your calendars—we can’t wait to dance with you!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/salsa-night-dance-party-w-2-live-bands/26081/
END:VEVENT
