DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261102
SUMMARY:Summers Farm Fall Festival
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our annual Fall Festival at Summers Farm! For over 30 years\, Summers Farm has been the go-to destination for fall fun in Frederick County\, Maryland. With 45+ exciting activities\, there’s something for everyone to enjoy! Whether you're planning a day of family fun\, a corporate outing\, a school field trip\, an adventurous day date\, or just some good old-fashioned fun—Summers Farm is the place to be this fall! Here's what we have planned: Pumpkin Train Photo Ops Specialty Food & Drinks Famous Corn Maze Petting Zoo Wagon Rides Pedal Car Track Giant Slides Local Food Vendors 45+ Attractions & so much more! September 26 – November 1 September Sat – Sun: 10am – 7pm October 1 – 4 Thurs – Sun: 1pm – 7pm (Thurs)\, 1pm – 9pm (Fri)\, 10am – 9pm (Sat)\, 10am – 7pm (Sun) October 7 – 31 Wed – Thurs: 1pm – 7pm Fri: 1pm – 9pm Sat: 10am – 9pm Sun: 10am – 7pm November 1 (Sunday only) 10am – 7pm *October 12\, 16 & 26th – School Daze Craze: 11:30am – 9pm
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/summers-farm-fall-festival/12916/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventswingforthefences3abeautifyingblueblazes26004-20260926@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20260926T141911Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260926
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260927
SUMMARY:Swing for the Fences: Beautifying Blue Blazes
DESCRIPTION:Join us to give our Blue Blazes Still an upgrade! The Blue Blazes Whiskey Still trail is along the site of a 1929 raid on a robust moonshining operation. Today\, a much smaller still takes its place along the Blue Blazes Creek. This still provides our easiest get-away closest to the Visitor Center and a crossroads of our historic and natural environment. Blue Blazes may not make moonshine anymore\, but it still is in our hearts. Help us give it some love this National Public Lands Day\, from its trailhead to the exhibit area! Volunteers will be working alongside Catoctin Mountain Park staff to remove and replace fencing along Visitor Center gravel parking lot and the Blue Blazes Still exhibit area. Please bring plenty of water. Sunscreen and bugs spray recommended. Appropriate attire and closed toed shoes required. Tools\, gloves\, and PPE will be provided. Pre-registration is required.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/swing-for-the-fences%3a-beautifying-blue-blazes/26004/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
